# ============================================================================
# One folder to skip.
#
# Everything that should not be published now lives in _not-for-upload/ —
# masters, superseded stills, working notes, the Cloudflare Worker source and
# the pre-compression city clips.
#
# It is a real folder rather than a list of names here because GitHub's WEB
# uploader does not read .gitignore at all. Dragging a folder into the browser
# uploads whatever you dropped, and rejects any single file over 25 MB — which
# is why a 36 MB master that git was correctly ignoring still blocked the
# upload. Moving those files out of the way is the only thing both paths obey.
# ============================================================================

_not-for-upload/

# --- housekeeping --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
node_modules/
